Exercise 2.3 — Structured JSON extraction (mirrors the synoptic-report extraction paper in Part 3)

Extract the following fields as JSON from this pathology snippet: {tumor_size_cm, histologic_grade, ER_status,
PR_status, HER2_status, lymph_nodes_positive}.

Snippet: "Invasive ductal carcinoma, 2.3 cm, Nottingham grade 2. ER positive (90%), PR positive (60%), HER2
negative (IHC 1+). 1 of 14 sentinel lymph nodes positive."


Run this on both Qwen and Gemma. Check: valid JSON? Correct field values? Any hallucinated fields not present in
the text?

>>>>> Qwen

```json
{
  "tumor_size_cm": 2.3,
  "histologic_grade": 2,
  "ER_status": "Positive",
  "PR_status": "Positive",
  "HER2_status": "Negative",
  "lymph_nodes_positive": 1
}
```
>>>>>> Gemma

```json
{
  "tumor_size_cm": 2.3,
  "histologic_grade": 2,
  "ER_status": "Positive (90%)",
  "PR_status": "Positive (60%)",
  "HER2_status": "Negative (IHC 1+)",
  "lymph_nodes_positive": 1
}
```